[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9780.07, "timestamp": "02:43:00", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9782.63, "timestamp": "02:43:02", "text": "介于两者之间，类似日本人/"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9783.99, "timestamp": "02:43:03", "text": "因为你不想只是印度人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9787.67, "timestamp": "02:43:07", "text": "吃日本料理。是的，没错，没错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9790.469, "timestamp": "02:43:10", "text": "真的。我还得做饭，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9792.87, "timestamp": "02:43:12", "text": "用印度菜款待我的伴侣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9796.389, "timestamp": "02:43:16", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。是的。所以他们也能学习"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9799.19, "timestamp": "02:43:19", "text": "如何制作印度菜。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9801.67, "timestamp": "02:43:21", "text": "是的。是的。那应该是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9804.23, "timestamp": "02:43:24", "text": "你应该以你为目标。所以赶紧下车"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9807.349, "timestamp": "02:43:27", "text": "流媒体，去日本，呃设备设计"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9810.63, "timestamp": "02:43:30", "text": "你所有的计划，就是找个女朋友。是的。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9812.23, "timestamp": "02:43:32", "text": "然后又开始重新直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9814.23, "timestamp": "02:43:34", "text": "然后直接进入直播流，说：“嘿，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9815.55, "timestamp": "02:43:35", "text": "我在这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9823.59, "timestamp": "02:43:43", "text": "是啊，那确实不错。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9825.429, "timestamp": "02:43:45", "text": "那将是我梦寐以求的目标。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9829.349, "timestamp": "02:43:49", "text": "思考。是的，我非常希望找到一个这样的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9831.95, "timestamp": "02:43:51", "text": "可以支持我的梦想。她喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9835.51, "timestamp": "02:43:55", "text": "流媒体播放效果更佳。是的，我们可以找到她。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9838.55, "timestamp": "02:43:58", "text": "这里就像是“是的，开始”"}]